## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Hubix source material.
##
## The prospectuses and inventory spreadsheets contain real prices, real
## developer terms and (in the admin columns) real buyer data. They stay
## out of this repository. Source lives in C:\Repositories\HubixDocs and the
## derived seed JSON in C:\Repositories\ClaudeLocalDocs\Hubix\seed-data.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
seed-data/real/

